{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game uses only two keys during gameplay: &quot;Forward&quot; and &quot;Backward&quot; \u2014 an extremely simple control scheme.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yet it delivers a challenging high-difficulty experience that truly tests your skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid a wide variety of gimmicks and traps as you aim for the top of &quot;HASHIGO,&quot; a tower consisting of over 200 floors!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203bThis game was created with RPG Maker MV</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbStreaming is allowed</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no restrictions on live streaming, uploading play videos, or monetization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbControls during the main game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2191 or D-pad Up\u2003---\u2003Move forward (climb the ladder)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2193 or D-pad Down\u2003---\u2003Move backward (descend the ladder)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >F5 key or L1+R1 triggers (pressed simultaneously)\u2003---\u2003Reset (return to title screen)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >F4 key\u2003---\u2003Toggle fullscreen / windowed mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbStage structure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A total of 5 stages, each consisting of dozens of floors</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 200 floors in total \u2014 a true test of endurance</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203bThe current floor number is displayed in the top-right corner</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203bYou can save your game each time you clear a stage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbMistakes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the player character touches an enemy or gimmick, they will fall (miss)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no traditional Game Over,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >but when you miss, you restart from a few floors back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How many floors you are sent back is random \u2014 sometimes you may have to redo dozens of floors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If your spirit breaks, that\u2019s the real Game Over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3754480?t=1764389535","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3754480?t=1764389535","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754480/5bf06da97791db16e2f5fc0c79d8d77851f906d4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764389535","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754480/5bf06da97791db16e2f5fc0c79d8d77851f906d4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764389535","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game uses only two keys during gameplay: &quot;Forward&quot; and &quot;Backward&quot; \u2014 an extremely simple control scheme.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yet it delivers a challenging high-difficulty experience that truly tests your skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid a wide variety of gimmicks and traps as you aim for the top of &quot;HASHIGO,&quot; a tower consisting of over 200 floors!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203bThis game was created with RPG Maker MV</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbStreaming is allowed</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no restrictions on live streaming, uploading play videos, or monetization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbControls during the main game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2191 or D-pad Up\u2003---\u2003Move forward (climb the ladder)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2193 or D-pad Down\u2003---\u2003Move backward (descend the ladder)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >F5 key or L1+R1 triggers (pressed simultaneously)\u2003---\u2003Reset (return to title screen)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >F4 key\u2003---\u2003Toggle fullscreen / windowed mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbStage structure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A total of 5 stages, each consisting of dozens of floors</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 200 floors in total \u2014 a true test of endurance</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203bThe current floor number is displayed in the top-right corner</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203bYou can save your game each time you clear a stage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbMistakes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the player character touches an enemy or gimmick, they will fall (miss)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no traditional Game Over,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >but when you miss, you restart from a few floors back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How many floors you are sent back is random \u2014 sometimes you may have to redo dozens of floors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If your spirit breaks, that\u2019s the real Game Over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["CAPT.G"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754480/d514319648981332e5d4b6a6805c89f2b30bd51f/header.jpg?t=1764389535","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3754480/1602423644/a7b6bfb88a7b22d92ebc394349e1760813dfeedc/1750382009/dash_av1.mpd?t=17491